---
name: no-scaley-em-overlay
enabled: true
event: file
action: warn
conditions:
  - field: file_path
    operator: regex_match
    pattern: apps/web/.*\.(tsx|css)$
  - field: content
    operator: regex_match
    pattern: scale-y-|scaleY\(
---

ANIMATION ANTI-PATTERN (CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md ⭐ canonical dropdown, if this project has one): `scaleY` distorts the text during the animation. For dropdown/menu/flyout/popover the canonical approach is usually **clip-path inset + translateY + opacity**, applied via plain-CSS classes keyed on `[data-state]`/`[data-side]`. For inline expand-collapse: `grid grid-rows-[0fr→1fr]` + child `overflow-hidden`.

If this use of scaleY is NOT an overlay/expand animation (e.g. a legitimate static transform), proceed — but state that in the verdict.
